{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["The reason for mentioning the foreskin of the fruit: because He mentioned the seed of the field and the seed of the woman, which is like the earth, He also mentioned that which is planted. And it is known that fruit produced up to three years has no benefit and causes harm, just as every fish that has no fin and scales harms the body, and the flesh of every bird of prey harms the soul of wisdom, and the unclean beasts. And the discerning will understand." "The meaning of <b>וערלתם ערלתו</b> [you shall count its foreskin]: that fruit is considered like a foreskin, which harms and does not benefit, like the foreskin of the lip and ear and the foreskin of flesh." "The meaning of <b>וערלתם</b> [you shall treat as foreskinned]: that it be considered in your eyes like a foreskinned thing. It is also well translated in Aramaic." "<b>יהיה לכם ערלים</b> [it shall be to you foreskinned] — meaning וערלתם [you shall treat as foreskinned]."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:11:15.757947655Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}